<title>USA: Calumet Bancorp completes stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Calumet Bancorp completes stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DOLTON, Ill. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calumet Bancorp Inc said Tuesday it completed its plan, originally announced May 31, 1996, to buy back 200,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Calumet Bancorp, holding company of Calumet Federal Savings and Loan Association of Chicago, had 2.4 million average shares outstanding at September 30.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
